sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant SPA as apps/admin
    participant API as blog.admin_routes
    participant Svc as blog.service
    participant San as blog.sanitize
    participant DB as Postgres
    actor Reader
    participant Web as apps/web

    Admin->>SPA: Save draft (title, body, brand, locales)
    SPA->>API: PATCH /admin/blog/posts/{id} + Idempotency-Key
    API->>San: allowlist body_html (no h1, CDN imgs only)
    San-->>API: cleaned HTML or ValidationError
    API->>Svc: upsert post + translations
    Svc->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE blog_posts, blog_post_translations
    API-->>SPA: 200 BlogPostOut

    Admin->>SPA: Publish
    SPA->>API: POST /admin/blog/posts/{id}/publish
    Svc->>DB: status=published, published_at=now (once)
    API-->>SPA: 200

    Reader->>Web: GET /{locale}/blog/{slug}
    Web->>API: GET /blog/{slug}
    API->>DB: published + locale row
    API-->>Web: 200 or 404
    Web-->>Reader: article + live brand buy card
